44. A COLA MAIS IMPORTANTE DO POSTMAN

Decore esta tabela:

Controller	Postman

@GetMapping	GET
@PostMapping	POST
@PutMapping	PUT
@PatchMapping	PATCH
@DeleteMapping	DELETE
@RequestBody	Body → raw → JSON
@RequestParam	Params
@PathVariable	escrever valor na URL
rota protegida	Authorization → Bearer Token
JSON	Content-Type application/json


E:

POST/PUT/PATCH
normalmente:
Body → raw → JSON

GET/DELETE
normalmente:
sem Body


